{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_franka_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_franka_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"驻足","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_franka_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"463b7e8ee7927c83b5eea8070a9d49b16f949dbb47e8013bcb328db4f592ba98","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"身边的人都在不断前进，她也该做出属于她的选择了。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"香草，你在这里做什么，这里不是......杰西卡的宿舍吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，芙兰卡前辈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我在帮杰西卡收拾房间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也是，我们勇敢的大小姐去了拓荒地，往后的日子里就不能经常待在本舰了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我和杰西卡说好了，我帮忙收拾她的房间，再帮她把东西寄过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我帮忙吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"不用，我去工程部借了一些装置，这点事情，我一个人就足够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个过自动门都会撞到的小姑娘，如今也成长了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡前辈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得，杰西卡错了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是她让你来问的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是的，明明做出了那种决定，却还是担心前辈对她的看法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不知道她是不是真的长进了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"......我觉得杰西卡很厉害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"她愿意抛下自己的那些东西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，不用急着帮她说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡有不少问题，但她总是知道自己在做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从一开始就知道，她不是需要担心的那种人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是我没想到，她做出决定的时间——会这么早。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"早......吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，她才二十岁出头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她还有许多时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，这也不是坏事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起那些无法做出决定的人，杰西卡已经比他们强太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"我也一直在思考自己的未来，但是一直无法做出决定，所以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗......不，我不是在说你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也还很年轻，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说的是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我说的是谁呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就去找信使寄东西了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"任务？我知道了，我马上就到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在任务结束之后，找一些消遣，然后等待下一个任务。\n这并没有什么问题。\n她这么想着，正打算离开房间，一个声音却让她停下了脚步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我的意愿没有改变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的愿望依然是创立一家属于我自己的安保公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克里夫先生想要和我谈谈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白，明天我会启程返回总部一趟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说芙兰卡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"放在往常，她会毫不在意地走到自己的搭档面前对她挤眉弄眼。\n要是她的心情再好一些，说不定还会做一些好玩的恶作剧。\n但是今天——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她知道我的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会和她讨论这件事的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我在躲什么呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你来得正好，我要回总部一趟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？发生了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和你提过的，我打算去和克里夫先生聊聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你终于下定决心了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，杰西卡那么勇敢，我觉得......我也应该再勇敢一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勇敢不代表无谋，你真的觉得自己已经准备好面对那个“桥夹”了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是你觉得应付不来，我陪你去也可以哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，我总得习惯这种事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这种心直口快的性格，对上那个阴险的老家伙，可是会被吃得死死的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡，你今天心情不好，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这和我有什么关系？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"整天应付你，我觉得，我还是锻炼了一些看人的本事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦，我们的优等生小姐也长大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我回来，我想和你聊聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"认真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"认真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我大概要去一个月，回见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，看来我的心情确实有点糟糕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汇报情况。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"和前期情报一致，这群盗匪绑架了运输站的工作人员，并且占领了那里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"他们的人数不少，装备也不差，但是戒备不算森严。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我已经摸清了建筑的结构和他们安插的点位，现在发送给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"唉，我原本还在好奇，你和雷蛇这样的精英被派去医药公司是不是有点大材小用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"现在我算是明白了，原来要做的事情没有什么变化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也可以申请去后勤部或者人事部，不用来遭这个罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"那可不行，外勤干员的待遇比我在黑钢时要好呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"而且，我早就想试试这种岗位了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前线可不是好玩的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"所以我才主动申请和两位前辈一起出任务嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"想必一定可以从优秀的前辈身上学到许多东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"战场的知识可没什么好学的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不会一辈子在战场上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"对我而言，这些都是能赚钱的知识！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"在能赚钱的时候多赚一点，然后我就可以去做想做的事情了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想做的事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"嘿嘿，其实我还没想好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"但我觉得我会想到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，年轻真好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"你也没比我大到哪里去吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论是在黑钢，还是在罗德岛，我都是你的前辈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"那您需不需要我来帮忙捶背揉肩呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"免了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，我已经制定好作战计划了，现在发送给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"这么快？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"呜哇，好详细！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让你别小看前辈的实力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我倒是从来没有小看过您老人家就是了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"分两队，A队负责正面牵制，B队负责救援人质。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"正面牵制的人数会不会太少了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根据之前的情报，他们的头目很警觉，人数多的话，他们很有可能选择逃跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让他们逃进山里就不好办了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"可是，这个A队人数......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是有人嘱咐过你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“因为雷蛇不在，所以你要多关注芙兰卡，不要让她冲动行事。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"唔。事先声明......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然不是雷蛇本人说的，我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的优等生小姐，会直接告诉我这一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过也是，我们拍档的时间，也有点太久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"久到连罗德岛发布任务的时候，也总是会把我们放到一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"这难道不是好事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得这是好事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"嗯——身边有个好伙伴总是让人放心的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"芙兰卡会在战场上因为寻求刺激而采取一些危险的行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"而雷蛇出于安全考量，会用各种方式制止她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"虽然她们经常吵嘴，但作战时配合无间，总是能够出色地完成任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我在黑钢时，就已经听说过你们二人组了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和她都已经习惯了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沃尔珀女性叹了口气。\n在进入黑钢的时候，大部分人都会选择一把制式武器。\n她虽然挑了一把制式短刺剑防身，但依然坚持使用自己的迅捷剑作为主要武器。\n时间久了，许多人都以为她只会使用那把迅捷剑。\n但实际上，她的短刺剑也用得很好。\n而现在，就连她自己也快忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，速战速决。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多亏了芙兰卡在正面牵制，我和其他队友顺利把人质救了出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是等我一回头，就看到他们把芙兰卡给堵住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"欸！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当时心都跳到嗓子眼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然对方的装备不算多么精良，但是，他们毕竟人多势众。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，他们意识到自己受到芙兰卡的戏弄，一个个都恨不得剥了她的皮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但芙兰卡却优哉游哉地站在那里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我心想，完了完了，难道雷蛇不在，芙兰卡打算放飞一下自我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在这时——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"就在这时？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，这可是独家新闻，想知道的话，可要付出一点代价。"},{"type":"narration","text":"杏仁比了一个钱的手势，露出奸诈的笑容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"......好、好吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用别人的故事赚钱可不好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这叫合理利用资源！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，雷蛇你回来啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (C)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (C)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在说芙兰卡吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (C)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我也听一听吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧好吧，今天就当作是免费大放送好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，这下搞得我反而有些罪恶感了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，说时迟那时快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡身处战场中央，而我则刚刚运送完人质，站在塔楼上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们并没有制定严格的时间表，她应该是不知道我的位置的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在那时，芙兰卡却精准地向我递了一个眼神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个眼神引导我看向另一边，那边，有一座危楼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而危楼附近，恰好是那群盗匪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我瞬间明白了她的意思——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她并不是因为莽撞而出现在了他们面前，她是故意引诱他们到达那个位置的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而连我会出现在那个位置她都料到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (C)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她可没有那么神通广大，只是算算时间，你或者其他队员也该出现了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那要是我们因为一些状况而没有出现呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (C)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她大概会去和你们会合，或许她也有第二手准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (C)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是我的话，可能会在危楼上事先安置炸药。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说来，芙兰卡确实事先问我要了一些炸药......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总觉得，这次任务中的芙兰卡，和之前的感觉并不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沉稳、可靠......虽然她平时也很可靠，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (C)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她人呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"好像出任务回来后，她就把自己关在房间里了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我还想找她庆祝一下呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (C)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我去找她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杏仁那个多嘴的家伙，现在大概在到处说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，算了，随她去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"桌边，母亲寄来的那封信依然完好地放在那里。\n她会准时地给母亲寄钱，也会热情地回复母亲的每一个问题，她很爱自己的母亲。\n但是有两个问题她始终避而不谈——\n你想要从事佣兵这么危险的职业到什么时候？\n你什么时候回家？\n这两个问题其实是一个问题。\n她相信母亲只是出于单纯的母爱才如此反复地提示，但对她而言，这两个问题蕴含的意义比任何人想象的都要重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沃尔珀女性打开从可颂那里淘来的二手唱片机，而后，将自己砸入柔软的床里。\n像是想要投入一个没有人认识自己的深渊。\n她从不认为自己没有做好准备。\n她认为自己在享受当下的每一分每一秒。\n但是，当杰西卡决定前往拓荒地，当雷蛇决定成立自己的安保公司时，她感到了一种失落。\n这种失落并非对未来的迷茫，她不是不知道自己该何去何从。\n而是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"有节奏且有礼貌的敲门声，她知道是谁。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她知道我在房间里，所以她会找到我藏备用钥匙的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，就是门边的花盆下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，她就会毫不犹豫地打开门。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，下次我还是换一个放钥匙的地方吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡，这可不像你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样才算像我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......至少不是现在这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"优等生小姐，现在有空吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我没有空，就不会来找你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是不是有一段时间没有对练过了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以说，你还是一本正经地把你的理想全部说了一遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟除此之外，我不知道别的做法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，比起逼你说一些冠冕堂皇的话，这样确实更加适合你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，结果如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不怎么样，克里夫先生并不看好我的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，他也说，他并不介意多一个偏远的合作伙伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"婉转的说法——安保公司之间没有真正的合作可言，一旦你脱离了黑钢，你和黑钢就不可能是朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"两人一边聊着，一边走向训练场的两端。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你应该听罗拉说了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我大概能理解为什么你会忽然找我对练。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天我会奉陪到你满意为止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"优等生小姐，你最近是不是有点太得意忘形了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是故意这么说的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"剑刃与盾牌碰撞，发出激烈的声响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，我还去见了几个从训练生时期一直保持联络的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们有不少人愿意跟我一起出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来你是回去参加“同学会”的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算不上，只是和他们聚了聚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们都提到了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，虽然你总是喊我“优等生”，但每次都拿第一、所有同届受训兵印象里最优秀的人是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对一个战士来说，“优等生”可不是什么赞美之词。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我呢，我从第一眼看到你，就看你不顺眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还记得我们两个第一次在模拟训练时对上的情景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当时是怎么说的来着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说，“让我看看优等生在实战里是不是也是优等生吧”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你从那天起就开始叫我“优等生”了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么记仇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以从现在开始放弃叫我这个绰号。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可不行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"两人对于对方的招式都无比熟悉，兵器碰撞声一时间填满了整个房间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，像你这样既不是野心家，又不是军火贩子的人，来当雇佣兵，实在是个怪胎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到今天，我也还是这么想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不想被嘴上说着因为寻求刺激而成为雇佣兵的人评头论足啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"变得越来越会说话了嘛，优等生小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多亏你教得好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才进房间的时候，我看到了那封信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这几年一直没有回去过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，我不知道见面的话应该和她说些什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得你和你母亲的关系并不差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何止不差，我很爱我的母亲，她也很爱我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她鼓励我去做自己想做的事，也不会强迫我做任何不想做的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的性格呢，其实就是被她这样惯出来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看得出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仅从性格而言，雇佣兵里和我类似的人有很多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是像你这样，能够在战斗中汲取乐趣，比起回避危险，更乐于享受的反而是少数。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是花了很长时间才能理解这件事的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你没有后顾之忧，所以你反而可以成为这样的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我真该给你看看我小时候的照片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是我自夸，但你可能不会见到比那时的我更加像富家小姐的孩子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，还是算了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，就算你想看，我也不知道还有没有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，妈妈肯定还保存着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，反正，我越是享受着我手中的一切，就越是害怕见到她——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不应该远行的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我应该陪在她的身边，开一家小店，收入能够应付生活支出就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我却无法克制自己对......这一切的向往。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"芙兰卡指了指手中的剑，而后转身看了一圈这座规模并不小的训练场。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在做自由佣兵的时期，她已经很担心我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我准备出发的那一天，她笑着把我送上了开往黑钢训练营的车。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我知道，等车开远了，她一定会哭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怕见到她，你会无法离开吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怕我会不由自主地和她争吵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明我很爱她，明明她很爱我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......原本我以为你只是心情不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，你的心情很不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多年下来，这是你第一次说这么多话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，从来都是你在那里说，我负责嘲笑你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，难道你的病情恶化了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，我的病情没什么大碍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会变好，也没有变得更糟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经开始习惯洗澡时摸到那些结晶的触感了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许是我疯了，谁知道呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并不认为人一定要拥有远大的理想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对我而言，从战斗中感受到自己一步一步的成长，从捉弄身边的人那里获得一点微不足道的趣味——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得已经足够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从黑钢到罗德岛，大部分时候我都过得很愉快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得，我是能够一直这样下去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到杰西卡，直到你，你们都做出了自己的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我才发现，其实并不是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不由自主地问自己——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我该何去何从呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡，你总是能把所有事情做好，你是许多人憧憬的对象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也包括我在内。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等，你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个第一次出任务就在战场上把我拦下来的家伙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这和以我的标准判断你的作战风格太过危险，并不冲突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一直以来，我都不太清楚我为什么会和你成为搭档，但是最近我逐渐想明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论你是怎么想的，但我一直想要知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像你这样和我完全不同的人，究竟是怎么看待人生的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许是直觉告诉我，我会从你身上学到许多东西吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不觉得你有从我身上学到什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很多东西，战斗技巧、语言艺术，还有一点......乐观的心态？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，这些与其说是学到的，不如说是为了跟上你的脚步而磨练自己得来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你和罗拉一起出的那次任务......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是芙兰卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起来需要一个支撑，但你并不是真的需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你需要的只是有人推你一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这算是某种决裂宣言？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想告诉你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不用太顾虑我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我现在发现，你真的越来越擅长让我生气了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多亏你教得好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"铝热剑脱手而出，在空中划过一道危险的弧线，而闪光盾也从瓦伊凡的手中不受控制地滑落。\n平局，一如既往。\n但芙兰卡并没有像往常一样，一边开雷蛇的玩笑，一边过去捡起武器。\n她呆立在原地，像是在思考些什么。\n而雷蛇仿佛也是在等待着她一样。\n半晌，她终于开口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说想和我聊一聊的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是邀请我去你未来想要成立的安保公司，是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暂时不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷蛇捡起铝热剑，芙兰卡捡起闪光盾，然后，互相丢给对方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的病情已经差不多稳定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我打算请个长假，先回家看看妈妈，陪陪她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许会和她吵一架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后......或许我会出个远门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接一点长期外派的任务什么的，去远一点的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许等我回来的时候，你的新公司已经成立了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到时候我可以请你来坐坐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也别高兴得太早。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当初，是你擅自跟着我来到罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说不定哪天，我在罗德岛待不下去了，就会死皮赖脸地去你的公司赖着了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起人情，我更看重规矩，你知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我到时候只好在你公司楼下打个地铺竖个牌子，再在上面写一些你的糗事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，我怎么会认识你这种人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，你怎么会认识我这种人，真为你感到遗憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中午吃点什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁请客？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧，今天我请。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","aliases":["芙兰卡","香草"]}]}
